This licence covers the source code only. The data the app reads is not part
of it:

- TTC delay data, routes and schedules, and municipal address points come from
  Toronto Open Data, under the Open Government Licence – Toronto
  (https://open.toronto.ca/open-data-license/).
- Basemap tiles come from OpenFreeMap at runtime, under OpenStreetMap's ODbL.
